---LINES
var     = pvi   -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
vari    = pvix  -       -       -       -         "3.141593"
varc    = pvix  -       -       -       -         "        " 
alt1    = paix  -       -       -       -         "YES"
a2      = aix   -       -       -       -         "[x]"
mse     = ipmx  -       -       -       -         " Quit "
VAR     = v   - - - - " VAR "
ALT     = a   - - - - " ALT "
MSE     = m   - - - - " MSE "
VARi    = gvx - - - - " VAR "
ALTi    = gax - - - - " ALT "
MSEi    = gmx - - - - " MSE "                       
                                                     
common  = c  "common..."                  
page_n  = c  "navigation..."                                        
specia  = c  "special..."                                           
activa  = c  "activate..."
onedit  = c  "editing..."
alt     = c  "alternate..."
---#hl      = g - hl - - "."            
---SCREEN  
=LINLIB actions

+.activa..........................                   .common.................   *
+ .MSE. select item    .:NL...| .:SP... .MSEi         .:HE... help              *
+                                                     .:EX... exit/close page   *
+ .ALT. alter           forward .:SP... .ALTi         .:NL... commit,complete   *
+                      backward .:DE...               .:CA... cancel            *
+                                                     .:RE... refresh page      *
+ .VAR. edit start    untouched .:SP... .VARi                                   *
+                  clean before .:DE...              .page_n..................  *  
+                                                     .:TA... next line         *
+.onedit..........................                    .:KH... jump to 1st line  *
+ .:DE... erase left from cursor  .alt..........      .:KE... jump to last line *
+ .:KD... erase below cursor       .:PR .:DE...       .:PD... next page/part    *
+                erase up to end   .:PR .:SP...       .:PU... prev page/part    *
+ .:KH... jump to 1st symbol       .:PR .:AL...                                 *
+ .:KE... jump to end of text      .:PR .:AR...      .specia..................  *   
+ .:KI... toggle Ins/Ovr mode      .:PR .:PR...       .:KP... keypad on/off     *
                                                      .:PR... prefix            *
